{"data":{"body":"[P2] Keep optional header capture fail-open for malformed diagnostics. The overridable `getCause()` is called twice outside a guard, so an ordinary accessor failure escapes `capture()` and fails the invocation. Read each cause once inside `try`/`catch`, rethrow only `VirtualMachineError`/`ThreadDeath`, stop on other accessor failures, and add an unreadable-cause test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76jse4","finding_digest":"ef51bb860b4b5f4163a2896de102928fef9f6a641a7daaf12951618023556a32","finding_id":"arf_v1_55i3xbqljnpucy5crfw6causr7","finding_key":"sdk/execution/runtime-trace-header::rethrow-fatal::unreadable-cause-escapes-capture","identity_key":"sdk/execution/runtime-trace-header::rethrow-fatal::unreadable-cause-escapes-capture","line":64,"observation_digest":"e382ffc9cd406b6a2d1a92fd89dd142dfca23fd6b65a10287c343dd825497fcd","observation_id":"aro_v1_4obp7sonibvwuli2sl6ytxiufx","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/RuntimeTraceHeader.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_55i3xbqljnpucy5crfw6causr7","published_at":"2026-10-07T06:10:11Z","review_id":"arr_v1_b6uppoo2uxcseal3hiinbtxkio","reviewed_base_sha":"f4e4e1db81c6fb0fbbaf25815d73757abf3fda7c","reviewed_head_sha":"78373abd264dea4c4c5ee5b2cc7c8982639c71af","reviewer":"codex","start_line":64,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_dnaznd43edb4qxiso4jk7wk7oh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T06:10:11Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
